WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.330
- Who understands the car accident?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.163
Okay.

00:00:04.163 --> 00:00:06.180
Were you just talking to them?

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.200
They're telling me.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.585
I go, "You're messing up this reading

00:00:08.585 --> 00:00:09.748
"over here trying to do this reading."

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:11.523
- I'm so sorry.
- So what I love about that-

00:00:11.523 --> 00:00:13.860
- [Kelly] I'm so sorry, what?

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.920
- Validating for you that they heard you,

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.720
do you understand that?
- Yes.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.400
- What plans changed that day?

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.690
'Cause what happened is
they put me in the car

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.100
and they switched my seat.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.300
So that's my symbol for that.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.170
Plans changed that day.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.843
They switched cars or
they switched drivers.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.780
- What?

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.780
- Well, we were supposed
to go out together.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.653
I stayed home.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.840
I acted like I was asleep

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.750
and she went with my best friend.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.460
It was both of them in the car

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.640
and usually when we went out together,

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.520
I always took a ride with the best friend,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.960
but since I wasn't there,

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.390
my sister did 'cause she
didn't like going in the car

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.967
with her and they died,
they both died tragically.

00:00:53.967 --> 00:00:55.728
- [Theresa] And you have
been carrying this burden-

00:00:55.728 --> 00:00:58.983
- Oh my God.
- For years, for decades.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.550
Validating for you that
they do not want you

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.100
to carry this burden of
feeling that if you were there

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.890
or somehow you could
have been responsible.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.300
Do you understand that?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.940
Or if you went, this
never would've happened.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.550
- Yes, tell her I miss her
and I love her so much.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.590
- You just did, ma'am.
- Oh!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.060
- She also just told me that you connect

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.190
with the song on the radio
that reminds you of her.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.780
It's not a top 40 hit,

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.613
right?
- Always.

00:01:22.613 --> 00:01:23.970
- Not playing it on purpose.
- No.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.500
- Know that that is her soul,

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.740
her energy that is with
you at the exact moment.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.610
So know that she wants
to thank you for that

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.530
and know that everything that you see

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.740
is truly her and that she hasn't left you.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.540
- Oh, thank you so much.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.890
- Don't thank me, thank her.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:41.723
- Thank you, Jen.

00:01:41.723 --> 00:01:43.350
- She's the one that did it.

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:45.450
- I love my sissy, she's the best.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:46.283
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:46.283 --> 00:01:48.270
- Do we understand the
hitting of the head?

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.560
- That was her, she hit her head.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:52.683
- Okay, and do you think
that she's suffered?

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.353
- I think she did.

00:01:54.353 --> 00:01:55.740
It was a tragic car accident.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.660
- 'Cause she hit me in
the back of the head

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:58.710
and then what she did

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.570
is she then had this blow to the chest

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:01.840
and she made me feel like

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:05.400
I immediately left the physical body.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.880
- Okay, so I was told that
before, oh my God, yes.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.207
- She says, "I need you to believe that,

00:02:10.207 --> 00:02:11.737
"I did not suffer to my death

00:02:11.737 --> 00:02:14.640
"or if anyone got to me sooner,
that I would still be here."

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:15.473
- Thank God.

00:02:15.473 --> 00:02:17.910
- Know that my soul immediately left.

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:21.030
- Oh, thank you, God.
- I'm very sorry for the loss.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.350
- Thank you so much.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.183
Thank you so much.

00:02:23.183 --> 00:02:24.150
- I wish you all the best.

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.740
- I appreciate you.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.680
- [Kelly] God, you do this all the time.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.536
This is so intense!

00:02:29.536 --> 00:02:30.693
- I could keep going.

